<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Open-Movie on Luccalug - Lucca Linux User Group</title><link>https://luccalug.it/tags/open-movie/</link><description>Recent content in Open-Movie on Luccalug - Lucca Linux User Group</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>it-IT</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 19:13:58 +0100</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luccalug.it/tags/open-movie/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Project Gooseberry - il primo, vero open movie della storia</title><link>https://luccalug.it/blog/2014/04/project-gooseberry/</link><pubDate>Fri, 11 Apr 2014 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://luccalug.it/blog/2014/04/project-gooseberry/</guid><description>&lt;figure class="figure"&gt;&#10; &lt;picture&gt;&#10; &lt;source&#10; type="image/webp"&#10; srcset="https://luccalug.it/images/blog/project-gooseberry/gooseberry-project_hu_be31870d60310cc8.webp 200w, https://luccalug.it/images/blog/project-gooseberry/gooseberry-project_hu_be31870d60310cc8.webp 200w"&#10; sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px"&gt;&#10; &lt;img&#10; src="https://luccalug.it/images/blog/project-gooseberry/gooseberry-project.png"&#10; srcset="https://luccalug.it/images/blog/project-gooseberry/gooseberry-project.png 200w, https://luccalug.it/images/blog/project-gooseberry/gooseberry-project.png 200w"&#10; sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px"&#10; alt="Project Gooseberry - il primo open movie della storia"&#10; width="200"&#10; height="300"&#10; loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"&#10; decoding="async"&gt;&#10; &lt;/picture&gt;&#10; &lt;figcaption&gt;Project Gooseberry: il primo film d&amp;#39;animazione completamente libero&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;La &lt;a href="http://blender.org"&gt;Blender Foundation&lt;/a&gt; sta chiedendo un finanziamento tramite crowdfunding per un grandissimo progetto: il primo Open Movie della storia, realizzato con Blender e completamente libero.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;I lavori precedenti come &lt;a href="http://www.sintel.org/"&gt;Sintel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="http://mango.blender.org/"&gt;Tears of Steel&lt;/a&gt; o &lt;a href="http://www.bigbuckbunny.org/"&gt;Big Buck Bunny&lt;/a&gt; erano semplici cortometraggi di 15 minuti; questo è invece un &lt;strong&gt;film d&amp;rsquo;animazione di 90 minuti&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>